cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "Code and results for: Correcting connectivity bias in meta-path gating for heterogeneous graph neural recommender systems"
abstract: "Source code, result files and figure scripts for density-corrected mutual information (DCMI), a meta-path scoring statistic that references a plug-in mutual information estimate against an ensemble of degree-preserving surrogate graphs, and for MIDGaP, a heterogeneous graph recommender whose meta-path gate is anchored to the DCMI prior and whose variational bottleneck is trained jointly with a ranking loss. Includes dataset construction, the estimator, nine baselines, full-catalogue evaluation, ablations, the sampled-versus-full protocol study, the uncertainty analysis and per-seed and per-user results."
authors:
